# Profiles saved by the app at runtime are local state, not source.

profile_saves/
*.log

# The run write-up, when it is saved into a working copy. The first two are
# what a run generates today; every glob here named a scheme this project had
# already stopped using, so the CURRENT name was the one thing not covered.
# The wildcards keep the artefacts of older runs ignored - those are still on
# disk under names nothing generates any more.
What-this-run-did.md
What this run did.md
What-*-did-run-*.txt
What-*-did-run-*.md

# Internal audit history. Part 1 is a list of defects that have all been
# fixed, so publishing it reads as a list of current ones.
SAFETY-AUDIT.md

# Build output. Regenerated by Tools\New-WDRelease.ps1 and
# Toolsxport-WDItemList.ps1; never a source of truth.
dist/

# Implementation notes for working ON the toolkit, not for people running it.
# Kept local: it is 8,000 lines of why-this-is-the-way-it-is, including a lot of
# "this was broken and here is how", and the research appendix folded in from
# the notes that used to sit beside it.
CLAUDE.md
